// Unit tests for the SecureSecrets library (cDPAPI and cCredentialManager).
//
// Runs as a console application by default; results go to the console that started the program
// and the exit code is 0 when all tests pass, -1 otherwise. Command line options (see DFUnit):
//   -g / --gui              show the DFUnit test runner window instead of the console
//   -o <file>               also write an XML report
//   --junit                 write JUnit XML to the console
//   --junit-file <file>     console output plus JUnit XML to <file>
//
// The tests call the real Windows DPAPI and Credential Manager. Credentials are only written under the
// target names "DFUnit.SecureSecrets.*", with session persistence, and are removed after every test.

Use DFUnit.pkg

Use cDPAPI.pkg
Use cCredentialManager.pkg

Object oApplication is a cApplication
End_Object

Object oSecureSecretsTests is a cDFUnitTestApplication
    Set psTestFixtureName to "SecureSecrets"
    Set pbUseUI to False

    Use TestDPAPI.pkg
    Use TestCredentialManager.pkg
End_Object
